      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to a little slice of heaven here in Anagassan in North East County Louth. This is a fantastic development set alongside the beautiful, quiet, discreet but very hip Anagassan village, where you`re going to find lovely amenities, from sea swimming spots to amongst the best eateries in the area, in the Glide Inn. You`re also going to find a really calm atmosphere, which is convenient to Dublin, Dundalk, and Drohada.\n\nNumber 15 The Saltings is part of a modern development, and the property itself is a ground-floor apartment set within a well-maintained development which overlooks the shore. The property is not only smart inside, but it`s also fantastic in its surrounding environment.\n\nThe property comprises:\n- two double bedrooms, one of which is en suite\n- a main bathroom\n- a nice open-plan kitchen/living area, which is basically plug and play, ready to go for its next owner\n\nThere are French doors leading out to the front of the property, but crucially also to the back of the property, where a short stone`s throw brings you right onto the shore and breathtaking walks along our gorgeous coastline in this part of the world.\n\nThis apartment will appeal greatly to owner occupiers, as well as people seeking an easy to manage holiday home that`s low maintenace and secure."
      },
